data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" the whole germ, these use only specific, purified pieces of the pathogen—such as its antigens, proteins, or sugars","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":"—that best stimulate the immune system (e.g., the HPV vaccine).\n4. **Genetic Vaccines (mRNA and DNA","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":"):** The newest frontier, utilized brilliantly during the COVID-19 pandemic. Instead of introducing an antigen, these vaccines deliver","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" a piece of genetic code (mRNA) wrapped in a protective lipid bubble. Our cells read this genetic instruction to temporarily manufacture the harmless","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" viral protein (the antigen) themselves. Once the protein is made, the cell destroys the mRNA. The immune system then","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" reacts to this protein, creating memory cells just as it would with any other vaccine.\n\nRegardless of the technology used, the end","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" goal of every vaccine is the same: to stimulate the creation of immunological memory without causing the disease and its potential complications.","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" \n\nWhen a person experiences mild side effects after a vaccination—such as a low-grade fever, fatigue, or soreness at the injection","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" site—it is often misunderstood as the vaccine making them sick. In reality, these are signs that the training is working","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":". The inflammation and mild discomfort are manifestations of the immune system actively engaging, recruiting white blood cells, and building its defense","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" infrastructure. \n\nFurthermore, widespread vaccination achieves something called herd immunity. When a vast majority of a population is vaccinated against a contagious","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

